      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TENNESSEE KADE (3) goes very well at the distance with three wins and a placing from six starts. Recorded a 5.5 lengths win (29.31) in a Grade 4/5 last time at this track. Makes strong appeal on best. ZIPPING VIOLET (1) jumped from out wide and was game in defeat last start when a 1.5 lengths second (22.97) behind Boston Strong at Richmond. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Overdue and gets her chance. CANYA HANDLE IT (8) has some solid form under his belt and proved too classy last time to win by 6 lengths at The Gardens in a handy 22.72 beating Mr. Speckle. Expected to feature again. RISE UP NISMO (2) is always hard to beat when drawn in this box.",
